{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-47-1","title":"Psalms 47:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The nations are exhorted cheerfully to entertain the kingdom of Christ.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A Psalm.This Psalm is supposed to have been composed by Solomon on the removal of the ark into the temple, 2 Ch ch. 7.</p>\n<p>for. or, of. 46:1; *title clap. 98:4; 2Ki 11:12; Isa 55:12 shout. 5; 98:4; 1Sa 10:24; 2Sa 6:15; 2Ch 13:15; Ezr 3:11-13; Jer 31:7 Zep 3:14; Zec 4:7; 9:9; Lu 19:37-40; Re 19:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-2","title":"Psalms 47:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>is terrible. 65:5; 66:3-5; 68:35; 76:12; 99:3; 145:6; De 7:21; 28:58; Ne 1:5 Na 1:6,7; Re 6:16,17 a great. 7; 22:27-29; 95:3; Da 7:13,14; Mal 1:14; Mt 28:18; Php 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-3","title":"Psalms 47:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>subdue. 18:47; 81:14; De 33:29; *marg: Jos 21:44; Php 3:21 our feet. 110:1; Jos 10:24,25; 1Co 15:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-4","title":"Psalms 47:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>choose. De 11:12; Jer 3:19; Eze 20:6; Mt 25:34; 1Co 3:22,23; Eph 1:18 1Pe 1:4 excellency. 16:3; Isa 60:15; Am 6:8; 8:7; Na 2:2 whom. De 7:6-8; 33:3; Ho 14:4; Mal 1:2; Eph 2:4,5; 1Jo 4:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-5","title":"Psalms 47:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>God. 24:7-10; 68:17-19,24,25,33; Lu 24:51-53; Ac 1:5-11; Eph 4:8-10 1Ti 3:16 with a shout. 78:65; Nu 23:21; 2Sa 6:15; 1Ch 15:28 sound. 81:3; 150:3; Nu 10:1-10; Jos 6:5; 1Ch 15:24; 16:42; 1Co 15:52 1Th 4:16; Re 8:6-13; 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-6","title":"Psalms 47:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>to God. 96:1,2; 117:1,2; 149:1-3; Ex 15:21; 1Ch 16:9; 29:20; Isa 12:4-6 Eph 5:18-20 our King. 145:1; Isa 33:22; Zec 9:9; Mt 25:34; 27:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-7","title":"Psalms 47:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>King. 2,8; Zec 14:9; Re 11:15 sing. 1Co 14:14,15; Col 3:16 with understanding. or, every one that hath understanding.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-8","title":"Psalms 47:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>reigneth. 22:27-29; 93:1; 96:10; 97:1; 99:1; 110:6; 1Ch 16:31; Re 19:6 throne. 9:4; 45:6,7; 48:1; 89:14; 94:20; Heb 4:16; Re 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-47-9","title":"Psalms 47:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":47,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":47,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>The princes, etc. or, The voluntary of the people aregathered unto the people of, etc. 72:7-9; 110:2,3; Ge 49:10; Isa 11:10; 60:4,5; 66:19,20; Ro 11:25 the God. Ge 17:7,8; Ex 3:6,15; Isa 41:8-10; Mt 22:32; Ro 4:11,12; Ga 3:29 shields. 89:18; Pr 30:5; *marg: he is. 46:10</p>"}]}